              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo tlahhsár ma'aay ar muqslír sirdaa/aat ar ta weeqatís gari tleéhh. Didá' gaa harwet gana tleéhh, saweemaá baraay a miíta tsár, nee gawa tlenaangós a harqoomoó miíta tsiyáhh nee tlaqi, nee harweeramoorós a miíta mibaá nee tám nee gár niina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kankemoodaá guruú baraywo muruú gaa harweer i deer, oo adór dahharoó muqsla oo tlenaango miíta mibaá nee tám nee tlaqi. Muruuwí tlahhsaadá' gana harweér hhai tsár, dahhaaráywí kwaa tleéhh a qoomár tawa tlahhsár tlehhiiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlahhsaadá' kari qaás gawaá slaqsa'aá awér mibaá nee tsár ar taa tleéhh ar muqslár da/aten, ar tám i /iikú ga/eér, ar tám i /uwaá ga/eér nee ar hatlá' tám i baskú ga/eér, nee ar tám i da/aá ga/eér. Tlahhsadá' kana qaás gawaá daandemooín, aler'ín sleémeero i baraá guruú do'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaankirós yangaremaawo a milimiíta mibeeri faanqw, tlehhmuuwós a adór /ayito'o. Tlahhsaarí gár ir hats a liíta kume mibeeri tsiyáhh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaardaá faanqw awa muqslaadá' da/aten gina tleéhh, umuú gaáriro tlenaangós a miíta tsár ga nakaa/, bihheerós aqo malé adoodá', tlenaangós oo gawa a miíta wak nee gár niiná. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Garduuká' adór kira tleéhh a adoorí. Boh'e gana tleéhh ar sihhteeraá muqsla gi oh, sihhteeriiká' dabe ngiri oohiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaadae slaqsa'aá direeri gina tleéhh, nee awa awe nee oo muruudá' ta bay keruúbi, nee slaqsi'iikaá direeri nee awa aweero kina warqeemaá taa parootuúsí hhaáf. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuú gaáriro i /angegeamaá tsiyáhh koón awa muqslár da/aten, muqslár kira óh a muqslár da/aten. Bihhe tsiyahhawo kiteeraá taa tleéhh a muqslír daa/aat nee baraá tla/aango muqslár da/aten i deer ar taa weeqatís as iimpe kawa gawaadií iwitisi. Umuú kitaango kwa parootuús ar /ayór taa tleéhh, ar harweeririim umuúqo bihhiiwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afkú gaári oo aa gáwtí ti'iit a tlaqtá miíta, guruú tsee/aawo afkú do' kwaa qaalín nee qaalirós bihhe sleémeero i alqoón ala a harweermorooká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee /angegeamaadá' tsiyáhh i baráy dirii'iyá' awa sihhteeridá' muqslidá' tla/aángwí dirii' tidá' /angeegé' gwaa harwet, kaa haragaás nee gaári. /Angeegeamoó wák tlenaango a sentimiíta mibeeri lahhoó' nee lahhoó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Angeegeuuwí a adór kuduú gaárír faras i uuruxun, nee muqslaadár tla/aango, nee harweermoorose, nee muqslaadár baraá guruú /angeege'e, muqslaarí sleémeero kana weeqatís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuú bihhaá baraay awa gaáriro, muqslír ga gáwtí koom kana qaás, muqslirí kaa haragaás nee gaári. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dír sagér gaarduukae hima i deer tlenaangós a sentimiíta mibaá nee dakaát gawa keemuuwo, nee wa/aamér ohiingós tidá' gáwtá haar nee dabeero tina oohiyé nee gaári. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slaqsa'aá keruúbi nee diraangw nee slansla giri gooín gawaá pa/eeraá naa meetiye' tla/ángw wa/ameedár ohiingw nee gawaá dabeero, gari harweér ar qaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy gaarduuká' mibaangw gina tleéhh ar adór wák.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Darama'aá mibaangw gina tleéhh ar muqslár da/aten, umuú gaáriro nee daraámuuwós. Baraá daraámuú wake ma'aá har liíta tsiire dakaát in faakiya'. Daraámu bihheero miíta tsár ga nakaa/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaardaá kooán gina qaás bihhaá basa awa do', nee awa kooán bihhaá /iya awa do'. Tlahhsaadá' gari qaás bihhaá baskú alda/aáw awa do'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiramu hutli'i gina tleéhh sleeme, nee kureemaá hhasaangw kwakwahh, nee búklaywo. Hiramu gadiyeédár waawutmo Solomon ar doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ sleémeero gari adoorír faák. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uheemaá tsár, nee búklaydá' urén ta slam'ií qamin gawaá uheemiiwo nee himtaawér tsár ar ta búklár tuuntukun kuduú gawaá sagér uheemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slaqsa'aá mamaá komamaánga a tsiire tsiyáhh as himtaaweedá' tsár, hha'aá tsár awa komamaánga ar umuúqo hhutlmoowo, kina parootuús ar slam'iidaá gawaá sagér uheemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sleeme gaardaá mibaangw gina tleéhh, nee iimpu mibaangw i gawaá gaarduudá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlahhsár wák gana tleéhh nee awér mibaá nee tsár gari baráy wa qaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee hutli'i nee kureemi nee búklaay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xosluudá' sleémeero Hiramu aa tleéhh as waawutmo Solomon baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ sleémeero ar muqslár taa weeqatís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo dír muqslaadá' ngiwa weeqatís a baraá xatstá Yordani, dír hhapeedár tleei ar tla/ángw Sukoti nee Saretani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon xosluudá' sleémeero gina máy sleeme gaa qoomeesiiká, asma ki ló'wa ur. Tam sleeme iilooeemaá muqslár da/aten ki xuiiká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon xosluudá' sleémeero dáw baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGUHE gana tleéhh, kitangwduú ilahhooa oo sahaábu nee meésár sahaábu as kawa mikaátér Mungú i qamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiteeraá tsaa'aso ki qamin gár kira tleéhh a sahaábuú hhohhó', ar kooán bihhaá basa nee ar kooán bihhaá /iya. Baraá kutuwidár baraá do' kiteeraá tsaa'aso gár kira tleéhh a sahaábuú hhohhó', nee /ayo nee tsaa'aso nee oohamaayi, sleémeero awa sahaábu. ",
          "type": "text",
